                            {
                                "example_id": "47fbf269-ae6c-4e1c-aab8-a749dd5f6fa9",
                                "sense_id": "17f31bdb-0d8b-38ea-bef5-75efee7f8c67",
                                "text": "На синева́том пла́мени горе́лки распла́вил кусо́к сургуча́ и края́ ко́локола припеча́тал к столу́, а на сургу́чных пя́тнах отти́снул свой большо́й па́лец.",
                                "translation": "Then he melted a piece of sealing-wax in the bluish flame of the Bun-sen burner, sealed the edge of the glass to the table and made a thumb print on the blobs of wax.",
                                "english": "Then he melted a piece of sealing-wax in the bluish flame of the Bun-sen burner, sealed the edge of the glass to the table and made a thumb print on the blobs of wax."
